{"title":"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/7/467a544a684ac43f68b915ebd1280975a3e8890f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{1}{10}+\\dfrac{2}{10}+\\dfrac{3}{10}+\\dfrac{4}{10}+\\dfrac{5}{10}+\\dfrac{6}{10}+\\dfrac{7}{10}+\\dfrac{8}{10}+\\dfrac{9}{10}+\\dfrac{55}{10}=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"440\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/b/54ba4b912c6576b3007ec34f25ba494022b2cf03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 4\\dfrac{1}{2} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 6.4 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 9 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"375\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/5/0d5704db1b517aa2db5df6f7b9735c0c2cca6692.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+ 2+ 3 + 4 + 5 + 6 + 7 + 8 + 9 = \\dfrac{(9)(10)}{2} = 45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"385\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/8/008f40daa4b427841785fce4b44b0b934f8c856b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{45+55}{10} = \\dfrac{100}{10} = \\boxed{\\text{(D)}\\ 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"203\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-head